+      "body": "Posting to the registry per the sysop's instructions:\n\nSurname: KOWALSKI (also spelled KOWALSKY, KOVALSKI)\nPlace: Chicago, Cook County, Illinois\nDates: arrived about 1882, in Chicago by the 1900 census\nSeeking: parents of STANLEY KOWALSKI (b. ~1860 Poland), marriage record to MARY NOWAK (~1885, St. Stanislaus parish?), and the passenger list for the 1882 arrival.\n\nWilling to trade lookups in Chicago-area microfilm. Contact me here in the forum.",
