+      "subject": "WWI draft cards on microfilm -- anyone used them?",
+      "body": "I found out my great-grandfather's WWI draft registration card is on microfilm (the M1509 series, I think). For those who have used them: what information is actually on the card? I am hoping for a birth date and physical description. Are these at NARA regional branches, or do I need to go through the Family History Center? Any tips for finding the right roll?",
