+      "body": "Considering a Roland JC-120 Jazz Chorus as the foundation for a pedalboard rig. The clean headroom is legendary and the stereo chorus is gorgeous, but it is solid-state -- will my Tube Screamer and RAT still feel right through it? I play in a Top 40 band and need pristine cleans plus convincing dirt at moderate volume. Anyone running dirt pedals into a JC-120 nightly? How does it take a DS-1?",
