+      "body": "Can anyone post a tab for the Sweet Child O' Mine intro? I have the D-C-G-D shape down but Slash's embellishments are faster than my ear. Standard tuning, and I know he plays it on the neck pickup of a Les Paul. Even a rough sketch of the first four bars would help. Happy to trade -- I have clean tabs for the Hotel California solo and the Stairway intro if anyone needs them.",
