+      "subject": "Syncing HR-16 drum machine to Portastudio 244",
+      "body": "Home recording question: I am tracking on a TASCAM Portastudio 244 (4-track cassette) and I want my Alesis HR-16 drum machine to stay in sync across takes. I know the 244 has no MIDI sync, so I am striping SMPTE-ish sync tone from a JL Cooper box to track 4 and slaving the HR-16 to it. It works, but I lose a track. Is there a better way short of buying a bigger machine? How are the rest of you syncing drums to cassette 4-tracks?",
