+      "section": "guitar_spinning",
+      "date": "12/13/88",
+      "author": "THRASHFAN",
+      "subject": "...And Justice for All -- where is the bass?",
+      "body": "Been living with the new Metallica record for three months now and I have to ask: where is the bass guitar? You can hear Newsted on exactly none of it -- the whole album is guitars, drums, and Hetfield's voice fighting for the same midrange. One is a masterpiece of arrangement, but the mix is so dry it hurts. Am I crazy, or did they bury the new guy on purpose? Still, that title track's middle section is the heaviest thing I have heard all year.",
